nces that is a small nudge up, to about 2.86."},"corners":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 10 corners","text":"The numbers say 9.8 corners, with Monaco expected to have most of the ball against Auxerre's back three and wing-backs. Filipe Luís wants more risk going forward, but that is how Monaco usually play at home against a side that sits deep, so I stay at 9.8."},"cards":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 4 or 5 cards","text":"The numbers say 4.5 cards and already add Stinat's slightly strict record (4.1 a game) and past meetings. Dioubaté returns for Auxerre and Coulibaly plays before his ban, but nothing points to a heated game, so I stay at 4.5."},"shots":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 24 shots","text":"The numbers say 23.9 shots. Filipe Luís admits his attack has struggled without Golovin, which is already counted, and Auxerre will sit compact and counter through Archer; nothing new points either way, so I stay at 23.9."},"shots_on_target":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 9 on target","text":"The numbers say 9.3 shots on target. With Namaso out as the numbers assumed, Archer is Auxerre's main threat, and Monaco's poor finishing in five winless games is already in their recent record, so I stay at 9.3."},"sources":["https://www.asmonaco.com/fr/news/conference-presse-monaco-auxerre-filipe-luis-filipe-luis-prendre-des-risques-pour-mettre-auxerre-en-difficulte","https://www.ladiagonale.net/index.php/2026/11/20/filipe-luis-maintient-le-flou-sur-la-presence-de-mawissa-contre-auxerre/","https://www.camfoot.com/actualites/ligue-1-danny-namaso-forfait-face-a-as-monaco,560799.html","https://www.eurofootnews.net/monaco-auxerre-ligue-1-11e-journee-compositions-probables-absents-et-enjeux-du-match-21-novembre-2026/20/11/2026/","https://www.sportsmole.co.uk/football/as-monaco/preview/monaco-vs-auxerre-prediction-team-news-lineups_609420.html","https://www.beinsports.com/en-us/soccer/ligue-1/articles/how-and-where-to-watch-as-